00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:13.970
And I had no interest
claiming that they're the one

00:11:13.970 --> 00:11:15.513
that told me to do...

00:11:15.513 --> 00:11:17.460
I didn't even wanna make myself vulnerable

00:11:17.460 --> 00:11:20.830
to somebody claiming that in
a meeting they were trying

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:22.700
to get me to partner with them

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:26.690
that when I then did what
they did, I was a dick.

00:11:26.690 --> 00:11:28.650
So I wouldn't even take the meetings

00:11:28.650 --> 00:11:31.300
'cause I didn't want the
reputational vulnerability

00:11:31.300 --> 00:11:32.960
'cause I knew there was
never gonna be a scenario

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:34.550
where I was gonna partner with anybody.

00:11:34.550 --> 00:11:35.913
I was gonna do everything.

00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:37.953
- [Robin] Perfect answer.

00:11:37.953 --> 00:11:38.786
Thank you.
- You know,

00:11:38.786 --> 00:11:40.610
it's a self awareness answer.

00:11:40.610 --> 00:11:41.540
Let me say one other thing

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:43.510
'cause in know this will
bring more value to everybody.

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:47.520
