to do voice in four years.

00:12:04.710 --> 00:12:06.810
'Cause their business will grow much more.

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:09.593
- [Robin] Love it.

00:12:09.593 --> 00:12:10.426
Thank you--
- But real quick.

00:12:10.426 --> 00:12:11.264
