00:12:39.553 --> 00:12:41.270
Right?

00:12:41.270 --> 00:12:43.500
I'm not talking about
TikTok a whole bunch now

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:45.040
'cause I just fuckin' discovered it.

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:46.830
I was one of the first
users of Musical.ly.

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:48.550
