00:15:48.280 --> 00:15:50.783
Guys, I ran ads on Google
the day it came out.

00:15:51.670 --> 00:15:53.810
I bought Google AdWords
for five cents a click

00:15:53.810 --> 00:15:55.630
the day it came out for wine terms.

00:15:55.630 --> 00:15:58.420
That was one of the biggest
reasons my library grew.

00:15:58.420 --> 00:16:01.910
I did email marketing in 1997, heavy.

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:03.510
It was my religion.

00:16:03.510 --> 00:16:05.970
I had 90 fuckin' percent open rates.

00:16:05.970 --> 00:16:07.990
It was unheard of.

00:16:07.990 --> 00:16:08.950
