00:16:08.950 --> 00:16:10.310
The same rate right now,

00:16:10.310 --> 00:16:12.050
I'm getting a million,

00:16:12.050 --> 00:16:16.130
I'm 100s and if not, 1000s of emails a day

00:16:16.130 --> 00:16:17.940
or DMs from people that are thanking me

00:16:17.940 --> 00:16:19.590
for telling them to go on TikTok.

00:16:22.570 --> 00:16:23.743
It's just arbitrage.

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:27.300
But people dig in on the thing they know

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:30.220
and aren't willing to kill
the thing that got 'em there.

00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:32.190
That's what's happening in this room.

00:16:32.190 --> 00:16:33.630
You're not willing to kill the thing

00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:35.420
that got you to the dance

00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:37.340
when it no longer is the thing.

00:16:37.340 --> 00:16:39.670
And so you start justifying
and you start shitting

00:16:39.670 --> 00:16:40.900
on the new thing,

00:16:40.900 --> 00:16:42.410
which gets you deeper in the hole.

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:44.110
Then you feel even further behind.

00:16:45.080 --> 00:16:45.933
That's the game.

00:16:46.796 --> 00:16:47.629
- [Audience Member] Preach.

00:16:47.629 --> 00:16:48.700
- That's the game.

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:49.533
- [Eric] Thank you.

00:16:49.533 --> 00:16:50.366
