00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:45.040
I think building all these
companies here is actually...

00:19:45.040 --> 00:19:47.170
To build a $100 million agency

00:19:47.170 --> 00:19:48.930
you have to be in the HR business.

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:49.763
- [Smitty] Sure.

00:19:51.810 --> 00:19:54.173
- You wanna get to the punchline?

00:19:55.220 --> 00:19:56.623
I spend all my time in HR.

00:19:58.520 --> 00:19:59.980
That's the answer.

00:19:59.980 --> 00:20:00.913
We sell people.

00:20:03.150 --> 00:20:05.430
And I don't understand how you don't...

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:06.700
You know how we make fun of,

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:08.180
Rachel probably covered it in some way,

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:09.700
but I'm not sure if she went there,

00:20:09.700 --> 00:20:11.860
when we scrutinize in the BC community,

00:20:11.860 --> 00:20:13.540
companies that are very good at CAC,

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:16.170
but suck at LTV, they loose.

00:20:16.170 --> 00:20:18.680
You can acquire customers all day long,

00:20:18.680 --> 00:20:20.240
but if you need to hold
onto them for four months

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:21.620
to make it pay off and they drop off

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:23.920
after two and a half months,
you're out of business.

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:24.753
And then when the price

00:20:24.753 --> 00:20:26.210
