00:20:26.210 --> 00:20:29.400
and your CAC has gone up,
you're really in deep shit.

00:20:29.400 --> 00:20:31.550
Yet we don't talk about LTV.

00:20:31.550 --> 00:20:32.844
Maribel, how many years
you been at Vayner?

00:20:32.844 --> 00:20:33.677
- [Maribel] Five.

00:20:33.677 --> 00:20:34.550
- I mean, these are real.

00:20:34.550 --> 00:20:35.870
When I got into the business,

00:20:35.870 --> 00:20:37.990
people... (laughs)

00:20:37.990 --> 00:20:39.030
This is super funny

00:20:39.030 --> 00:20:39.863
'cause now I'm thinking.

00:20:39.863 --> 00:20:40.696
I forgot.

00:20:40.696 --> 00:20:43.053
Lot's of people came to give me advice.

00:20:44.482 --> 00:20:48.190
I'm a nice guy so I was cordial,

00:20:48.190 --> 00:20:51.322
but in my brain I'm like, "Motherfucker.

00:20:51.322 --> 00:20:52.777
(laughing)

00:20:52.777 --> 00:20:54.882
"My business is gonna be
bigger than yours in 36 months

00:20:54.882 --> 00:20:57.230
"and I don't even know what I'm doing yet.

00:20:57.230 --> 00:20:58.330
So your advice is cool,

00:20:58.330 --> 00:21:00.887
