00:21:02.870 --> 00:21:04.607
I'm like, "No, no, your people

00:21:04.607 --> 00:21:06.227
"are gonna stay for 18 to 24 months.

00:21:06.227 --> 00:21:08.657
"My people are gonna stay
for five, 10, and 15 years

00:21:08.657 --> 00:21:10.807
"'cause I actually give
a fuck about them."

